<title>USA: Internet Financial Network names senior VP.</title>
<headline>Internet Financial Network names senior VP.</headline>
<dateline>DAVIE, Fla. 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Internet Financial Network said Monday it has appointed Margaret Grisdela to the new position of senior vice president of its unit EDGAR Services.</p>
<p>Grisdela joined the company from F.W. Dodge, a unit of The McGraw-Hill Cos Inc, where she served as vice president of editorial.</p>
<p>EDGAR Services is an online service that provides access to corporate filings with the Securities and Exchange Commission.  </p>
<p>Internet Financial Network is 51 percent beneficially owned by The Travelers Group and Data Broadcasting Corp.</p>
